  "tg.help": "*Lookout* — Frigate NVR → Telegram bridge\n\nSubscribes to Frigate MQTT events and sends snapshots, video clips and GIF previews to Telegram.\n\n*Commands:*\n/status — current view from cameras\n/last \\[N] \\[object] — last N events of every camera (e.g. `/last 3 person`)\n/last camera \\[N] \\[object] — last N events of one camera\n/stat \\[24h|7d|30d|today] \\[camera|object] — event statistics\n/clip id — clip of an event (the id is in the notification)\n/mute \\[camera] \\[30m|2h|1d] — turn notifications off (all cameras, 1 hour by default)\n/unmute \\[camera] — turn notifications back on\n/help — this help\n\n*Project:* [github.com/rsvln/lookout](https://github.com/rsvln/lookout)\n\n*License:* MIT",
